<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Credito started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Credito started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings analyst Nuno Fernandes has started coverage of Brazil's Banco Credito Nacional SA with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a July 14 report, he forecast an &quot;expected total return of 70 percent on the preferred shares, including a five percent dividend yield.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Banco Credito Nacional is Brazil's fifth-largest private bank and &quot;a strong candidate for a potential acquisition by one of the foreign banks that intend to enter or expand operations in Brazil.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
